{"availability":"available","full":"bensheldon/good_job","name":"good_job","description":"Multithreaded, Postgres-based, Active Job backend for Ruby on Rails.","category":"Other","language":"Ruby","stars":3000,"forks":258,"created":"2020-02-24T15:01:22Z","updated":"2026-10-10T19:52:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://goodjob-demo.herokuapp.com/","topics":["activejob","activejob-backend","hacktoberfest","multithreaded","rails","ruby","ruby-on-rails"],"demo":"https://goodjob-demo.herokuapp.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T04:05:44.660Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T04:05:44.660Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T04:05:44.660Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:52:07.761Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:52:07.761Z","stars":2998,"forks":258},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:35:34.913Z","stars":3000,"forks":258},{"at":"2026-10-12T04:05:44.660Z","stars":3000,"forks":258}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GoodJob is a multithreaded, Postgres-based, Active Job backend for Ruby on Rails.","Inspired by Delayed::Job and Que, GoodJob is designed for maximum compatibility with Ruby on Rails, Active Job, and Postgres to be simple and performant for most workloads.","For more of the story of GoodJob, read the introductory blog post."],"features":["Designed for Active Job. Complete support for async, queues, delays, priorities, timeouts, and retries with near-zero configuration.","Built for Rails. Fully adopts Ruby on Rails threading and code execution guidelines with Concurrent::Ruby.","Backed by Postgres. Relies upon Postgres integrity, session-level Advisory Locks to provide run-once safety and stay within the limits of schema.rb, and LISTEN/NOTIFY to reduce queuing latency.","Fully featured. Includes support for cron-like scheduled jobs, batches, concurrency and throttling controls, and a powerful Web Dashboard (check out the Demo).","Flexible and lightweight. Safely runnable within a single existing web process or scaled via an independent CLI process across development, test, and production environments."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c781a73e3d82ec5d5597da01818d5ab73f74b92ce83810140c5df999ea797035","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:38:57.030Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:38:57.030Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GoodJob is a multithreaded, Postgres-based, Active Job backend for Ruby on Rails.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Inspired by Delayed::Job and Que, GoodJob is designed for maximum compatibility with Ruby on Rails, Active Job, and Postgres to be simple and performant for most workloads.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md"},{"text":"Designed for Active Job. Complete support for async, queues, delays, priorities, timeouts, and retries with near-zero configuration.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"GoodJob offers Concurrency and Throttling Controls, but isolation is always the most performant and reliable option, though it requires dedicated resources and costs more.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c781a73e3d82ec5d5597da01818d5ab73f74b92ce83810140c5df999ea797035","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:38:57.032Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T23:22:46Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bensheldon/good_job/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T00:02:58.648Z","hash":"950d406b2e007a8c8b547557ff838f555c25f89aa99d24077ec1fb9e300a9fdd","originalBytes":104398,"storedBytes":104398,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["job","jobs","good","goodjob","ruby","rails","when","default","